# CMake build output (regenerated by `cmake -B build`; includes the fetched
# JUCE source under build/_deps and the compiled .vst3 artefact).
# NOTE: the top-level cmake/ folder is NOT ignored — it holds CPM.cmake, which
# CMakeLists.txt includes to bootstrap dependency fetching, and must be committed.
/build/

# Common alternative build dir names
/cmake-build-*/
/out/

# IDE / editor
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user

# Local working context (see CLAUDE.md's Local working context section)
CLAUDE.local.md

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/_old
/_upcoming
/_reference_docs

# Local dev aids: standalone triage scripts (e.g. the SMF dumper used to diagnose
# imported charts) plus any .mid dropped in for inspection. Useful to Claude and
# to local debugging, not to the shipped plugin.
/_dev_tools